  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_decorations/banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"659\" height=\"132\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>裝飾</strong> 模組，為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fantasys-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fantasy's Furniture</strong></a> 的擴充，新增了各種裝飾方塊，包含但不限於：<strong>莓果籃</strong>、<strong>硬幣堆</strong>、<strong>蠟燭</strong>、<strong>骨堆</strong> 以及其他更多內容！</p><p>此模組中許多方塊的設計均為了搭配我們的<strong>家具系列</strong>，但也有部分方塊並不屬於特定家具系列。</p><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.apexmodder.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我們的 <strong>Discord</strong></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.apexmodder.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/third_party/discord_banner.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"174\" height=\"59\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fapexstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/f4d8198a-6c2a-4d86-8d74-1977589e8ef7.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
